    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870/extras/9fb1638a03ae0140b62b8c86f4479839.avif?t=1752861177\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEMINIST METEORITE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hentai game and visual novel parody set in a post-apocalyptic world where a meteorite has struck Earth, wiping out all men and leaving only women alive. Before the disaster, a scientist created a special capsule combining the best male genes to preserve humanity\u2019s last hope. The result was a caveman whose mission is to repopulate the world and prevent the extinction of the species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a planet inhabited solely by semi-human women who only accept the strongest as a mate, they agree to have sex with the caveman\u2014but only if he defeats them in combat first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story filled with comedy, action, and plenty of erotic content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel, hentai, turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warning!</strong> This game contains explicit sex, sexual acts, inappropriate language, violent behavior, and sexual assault. All characters depicted are adults, and none of these characters or scenes are real; they are parodic interpretations created for humorous, entertainment, and artistic purposes. We do not seek to glorify or promote the behaviors depicted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870/extras/e929069c2fde98c641f406dadd24e971.avif?t=1752861177\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870/extras/8045fdcd733733d26bd1dc0e705b44a9.avif?t=1752861177\" width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870/extras/797b64e9f831d3e2969b2edc792c1d10.avif?t=1752861177\" width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870/extras/1620b9049adfd9f65e5d4ad361f124bc.avif?t=1752861177\" width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870/extras/ba32628ff99d5e9c0738c145f9b24fb2.avif?t=1752861177\" width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870/extras/7eab53bb7e327e996444faaea1c87885.avif?t=1752861177\" width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870/extras/ab3748c22eca246773bd8acfba932851.avif?t=1752861177\" width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870/extras/9fb1638a03ae0140b62b8c86f4479839.avif?t=1752861177\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEMINIST METEORITE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hentai game and visual novel parody set in a post-apocalyptic world where a meteorite has struck Earth, wiping out all men and leaving only women alive. Before the disaster, a scientist created a special capsule combining the best male genes to preserve humanity\u2019s last hope. The result was a caveman whose mission is to repopulate the world and prevent the extinction of the species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a planet inhabited solely by semi-human women who only accept the strongest as a mate, they agree to have sex with the caveman\u2014but only if he defeats them in combat first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story filled with comedy, action, and plenty of erotic content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel, hentai, turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warning!</strong> This game contains explicit sex, sexual acts, inappropriate language, violent behavior, and sexual assault. All characters depicted are adults, and none of these characters or scenes are real; they are parodic interpretations created for humorous, entertainment, and artistic purposes. We do not seek to glorify or promote the behaviors depicted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870/extras/e929069c2fde98c641f406dadd24e971.avif?t=1752861177\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843870